  "id": "pre-event",
  "title": "Pre-event Planet Quarterly Basemap (Q1 2026)",
  "description": "Planet Global Quarterly Mosaic for Q1 2026 over the affected region of coastal Venezuela — a cloud-free medium-resolution (~4.8 m) RGB basemap from before the 24 June 2026 earthquake, for before/after comparison. 40 tile Items (each with a quad thumbnail) plus a 41st Item carrying the merged whole-region COGs.",
  "license": "CC-BY-NC-4.0",
  "keywords": [
    "Venezuela",
    "basemap",
    "Planet",
    "quarterly mosaic",
    "pre-event",
    "RGB"
  ],
